    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stones known as &quot;Skill Gems&quot; have fallen from the sky all over the world. Equipping these gems grants powerful attack abilities. People scramble to find Skill Gems to survive, and some even see them as a chance to dominate the world. The battle is about to begin!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Form a Battle Team</strong>: Command brave warriors, equip them with powerful Skill Gems, and make them unstoppable on the battlefield.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Strategy</strong>: Assign Skill Gems in a simple and intuitive way to plan skill deployment strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thrilling Combat</strong>: Take direct control of warriors in intense battles or delegate control to the AI and focus on tactical planning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Challenges</strong>: Explore diverse levels, collect more Skill Gems, and take on increasingly powerful enemies, including formidable bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arena Mode</strong>: Compete against other players in fierce arenas where wisdom and strength collide, fighting for glory and generous rewards.</p></li></ul>",
